WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.293 --> 00:00:06.882
♪♪

00:00:06.882 --> 00:00:09.843
Holston:
We do not know how long we have
been underground.

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:12.721
♪♪

00:00:12.721 --> 00:00:14.389
Holston:
Or who built the silo.

00:00:14.389 --> 00:00:19.519
♪♪

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:23.065
Holston:
We do not know why there is no
life outside this silo.

00:00:23.065 --> 00:00:29.321
♪♪

00:00:29.321 --> 00:00:31.114
Holston:
We only know that here is safe.

00:00:31.114 --> 00:00:33.325
♪♪

00:00:33.325 --> 00:00:34.493
And there is not.

00:00:34.493 --> 00:00:40.582
♪♪

00:00:40.582 --> 00:00:44.544
Juliette:
Have you ever noticed
anything...strange...

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:47.631
♪♪

00:00:47.631 --> 00:00:48.382
...about the silo?

00:00:48.382 --> 00:00:50.133
♪♪

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:53.095
Some mysteries are best left
unsolved.

00:00:53.095 --> 00:01:04.856
♪♪

00:01:04.856 --> 00:01:06.233
What's the big question? 

00:01:07.568 --> 00:01:10.862
What if everything you know to
be true... 

00:01:10.862 --> 00:01:16.243
♪♪

00:01:16.243 --> 00:01:17.953
George:
...was one big lie?

